{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31719","headline":"感秋 · 贾岛","name":"感秋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"商气飒已来，岁华又虚掷。\n朝云藏奇峰，暮雨洒疎滴。\n几蜩嘿凉叶，数蛩思阴壁。\n落日空馆中，归心远山碧。\n昔人多秋感，今人何异昔。\n四序驰百年，玄发坐成白。\n喧喧徇声利，扰扰同辙迹。\n傥无世上怀，去偃松下石。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}